@page
@model NetworkModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The Monerica Network";
}

<div class="about-content">
    <h1>The <span>Monerica</span> Network</h1>

    <p>
        MoneroShameList.com is part of the <strong>Monerica network</strong> — a family of independent,
        privacy-respecting projects for the Monero community. Each site links back to the others, so you
        can always find your way around. Explore the rest of the network:
    </p>

    <h2>Sites in the network</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <a href="https://monerica.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Monerica.com</a>
            &mdash; the Monero circular-economy directory: merchants and services that accept XMR.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://moneroacademy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoneroAcademy.com</a>
            &mdash; free Monero education: courses, lessons and quizzes from beginner to advanced.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://moneropricenow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoneroPriceNow.com</a>
            &mdash; the live Monero (XMR) price, clean and tracker-free.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://moneromarketcap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoneroMarketCap.com</a>
            &mdash; Monero market data, supply and statistics.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>MoneroShameList.com</strong> &mdash; you are here: a watchlist of privacy-focused
            companies that don't yet accept Monero.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://blog.monerica.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Blog.Monerica.com</a>
            &mdash; the Monerica project blog: guides, updates and deep dives on Monero.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://moneromaps.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoneroMaps.com</a>
            &mdash; an interactive map of real-world businesses that accept Monero (XMR).
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://video.monerica.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Video.Monerica.com</a>
            &mdash; Monerica's YouTube videos on their own site: Monero guides, reviews and walkthroughs. No JavaScript, no trackers, and on Tor too.
        </li>
        <li>
            <a href="https://monerouserforum.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoneroUserForum.com</a>
            &mdash; the community discussion forum for Monero users.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Follow the project</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@@monericaproject" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Monerica Project on YouTube</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/MonericaProject" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Monerica Project on X (Twitter)</a></li>
    </ul>
</div>
